        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"c4ca43b9-6634-45e5-9c29-0976ecaa156c\",\"review_text\":\"It is indeed Premium 😌\"},{\"review_id\":\"f63f09ea-db8b-4e68-996a-873421bf8aed\",\"review_text\":\"👌\"},{\"review_id\":\"cf247888-4dcc-4f49-a7a4-5158cfd2f63a\",\"review_text\":\"All d music u like\"},{\"review_id\":\"57a29792-2a36-49eb-8405-b0c84d4e9013\",\"review_text\":\"I only downloaded this app because of their brand ambassadors BTS 💜 but after I used this app this app actually turned out amazing 🤩\"},{\"review_id\":\"e0b06a4c-16e0-4ebb-b526-4ec7ce140cd7\",\"review_text\":\"I'm deleting this app coz this came from sweden as they burn our holy Quran so we r with #boycot\"},{\"review_id\":\"e6d5136d-1eb9-45be-947b-be000c1bcf53\",\"review_text\":\"Absolutely amazing! Even if you don't have premium it's an amazing experience. I have premium and it's even better. Especially with there seasonal deals. Love Spotify!🥰\"},{\"review_id\":\"2ec12ee7-a140-4d71-87ef-4f0f66c41c21\",\"review_text\":\"It was very good music app now it's the worst ever music app\"},{\"review_id\":\"a9057b6f-2a1d-4ad1-936d-d0bab81e07cb\",\"review_text\":\"I love this app bcoz I always listen to bts but now this New version change my view on this plz go back to your old version plz or this ratings will only go down\"},{\"review_id\":\"10800b01-920d-4c22-91f5-521c45caf4f0\",\"review_text\":\"They will offer you 3 months and charge you the next month. Customer service is rude, useless and ignorant. They indirectly called me a liar and made me feel bad by forcing me to screenshot proof of what I said was true. Not even a complimentary free month for their disrespectful customer service. Bs company.\"},{\"review_id\":\"c6066ced-6402-460e-93c6-ebb5e72fba4b\",\"review_text\":\"ads!!!\"}]}"
